    "note": "Palácio do Planalto with a thin overhanging roof, two rows of curved white piers, a raised glazed volume, a long ceremonial ramp and a linked speaker platform facing Praça dos Três Poderes. The 1058 m reference datum comes from unchanged standard Terrarium elevation. Exterior foundations and the ramp toe sample the local grade. The modeled ramp and short at-grade approach replace the mapped elevated footway and rise to the level public entrance. Preview places the authored base at the recorded absolute sea-level elevation; local tide and terrain resolution remain host-dependent."
